      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "See what needs you",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>Needs you</strong> counts the flights not reported yet. Open the mission and tap <strong>Report</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2e74cdf547c5421a.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Say what happened",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap one result. Add a short <strong>Comment</strong> if it helps, then tap <strong>Send</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0131edff601b758d.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Send the report",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The mission moves to <strong>Finished missions</strong>, and the asker and everyone else see the result.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8c9b1c1f986e7181.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Fly again",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>After a hit, a miss or nothing seen, a lost drone or an abort, <strong>Fly again</strong> plans another drone on the same request. <strong>‹</strong> leaves without sending.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c76faa7504a2eb4e.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "A recon's report",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>A recon asks <strong>What did the drone see?</strong> instead. Pick what fits, here <strong>Done as planned</strong>, and tap <strong>Send</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/aba52317722aebb2.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
